WEBVTT

1
00:59:04.330 --> 00:59:05.330
Hallelujah.

2
00:59:06.330 --> 00:59:07.330
Hallelujah.

3
00:59:08.330 --> 00:59:09.330
Is everyone happy?

4
00:59:11.330 --> 00:59:13.330
That’s three people. Is everyone happy?

5
00:59:20.330 --> 00:59:23.330
Who watched the match last night? Anyone else?

6
00:59:25.330 --> 00:59:26.330
That’s cool, right?

7
00:59:27.330 --> 00:59:29.330
Dutch people in the room. Are there any Dutch people here?

8
00:59:30.330 --> 00:59:31.330
Ah, look!

9
00:59:33.330 --> 00:59:37.330
Really. But was that a nice time last night, right?

10
00:59:38.330 --> 00:59:39.330
It was exciting, wasn’t it?

11
00:59:40.330 --> 00:59:43.330
Netherlands against the Turks!

12
00:59:45.330 --> 00:59:47.330
Delightful. How much I enjoyed it.

13
00:59:48.330 --> 00:59:52.330
And at the beginning of the match, all those Turks, they were all praying to Allah.

14
00:59:54.330 --> 01:00:00.330
And the Dutch, a very devout group of Dutch people, they also prayed.

15
01:00:00.330 --> 01:00:04.330
And at the end they sang Our God is greater.

16
01:00:06.330 --> 01:00:08.330
But it was exciting. It was exciting.

17
01:00:09.330 --> 01:00:15.330
And I lost my voice. I left it there yesterday. I think they heard it in Berlin.

18
01:00:16.330 --> 01:00:21.330
Super fun. Super fun. But Jesus is so much greater than anything on earth. Amen?

19
01:00:22.330 --> 01:00:23.330
Amen, amen, amen.

20
01:00:24.330 --> 01:00:25.330
Robert, may I invite you to the stage?

21
01:00:26.330 --> 01:00:34.330
Robert is going to teach today about the collections. Today, the collections will go towards the new construction project.

22
01:00:35.330 --> 01:00:42.330
We have indicated each time that we will clearly specify to the church every time, every month, where it is going.

23
01:00:43.330 --> 01:00:46.330
Of course, we give money to the daily operations of the church.

24
01:00:47.330 --> 01:00:49.330
But we also have all those projects that we have running in Open Church.

25
01:00:50.330 --> 01:00:56.330
And it is important that we communicate this well, so that we all know where we give in the name of Jesus. Amen?

26
01:01:02.330 --> 01:01:08.330
God has called us to build a new building. So that is what we are going to do.

27
01:01:09.330 --> 01:01:14.330
But that won't happen just like that. Millions are even needed for that.

28
01:01:14.330 --> 01:01:22.330
And so we are working together to raise money to make this possible.

29
01:01:23.330 --> 01:01:27.330
And we have already raised a significant amount.

30
01:01:28.330 --> 01:01:39.330
This is the amount we had three months ago as savings. 665,000. That is a significant amount, isn't it?

31
01:01:39.330 --> 01:01:48.330
And you have given generously over the past three months as well. More than 21,000 euros has been added.

32
01:01:52.330 --> 01:01:57.330
Thank you to everyone who faithfully contributes to this congregation.

33
01:01:58.330 --> 01:02:01.330
Now you can look at this in different ways.

34
01:02:02.330 --> 01:02:06.330
You can look at 21,000 euros, that is a lot of money.

35
01:02:06.330 --> 01:02:08.330
I don't just have that lying around.

36
01:02:09.330 --> 01:02:15.330
You can also look at it from the perspective of 21,000 euros, while we need millions. That doesn't help much.

37
01:02:16.330 --> 01:02:18.330
We will eventually have to buy buildings.

38
01:02:19.330 --> 01:02:23.330
But you know, God is a God of miracles.

39
01:02:24.330 --> 01:02:29.330
God does not build in the worldly way that we are used to building.

40
01:02:30.330 --> 01:02:32.330
God builds in a completely different way.

41
01:02:32.330 --> 01:02:44.330
Then I want to take a moment to look with you at a few examples of what happened during the time in the desert with the people of Israel and how God was at work there.

42
01:02:45.330 --> 01:02:49.330
God had led the people out of Egypt where they were slaves.

43
01:02:50.330 --> 01:02:54.330
And they had just departed and they arrived at the Red Sea.

44
01:02:54.330 --> 01:02:59.330
And the army of the Egyptians was pursuing them.

45
01:03:01.330 --> 01:03:04.330
And they had been slaves.

46
01:03:05.330 --> 01:03:12.330
So they were not an army that could fight against those Egyptians to try to win that battle.

47
01:03:13.330 --> 01:03:15.330
And they were stuck there, they could not go anywhere.

48
01:03:16.330 --> 01:03:20.330
And then God says to Moses, take your staff and strike the water.

49
01:03:20.330 --> 01:03:23.330
Moses takes his staff and strikes the water.

50
01:03:25.330 --> 01:03:29.330
And Moses does that and the sea splits and the people go through it.

51
01:03:31.330 --> 01:03:33.330
What happens here? Step 1.

52
01:03:34.330 --> 01:03:35.330
Hearing God's voice.

53
01:03:37.330 --> 01:03:39.330
God says strike the water with your staff.

54
01:03:40.330 --> 01:03:41.330
Step 2 faith.

55
01:03:43.330 --> 01:03:46.330
Believe that something will happen when you just do what God says.

56
01:03:47.330 --> 01:03:48.330
Step 3 obedience.

57
01:03:48.330 --> 01:03:50.330
Obedience. Just do what God says.

58
01:03:52.330 --> 01:03:55.330
They have traveled a few weeks through that desert.

59
01:03:56.330 --> 01:04:00.330
And then they come to an area and God says send some men out.

60
01:04:01.330 --> 01:04:05.330
They need to go see how things are there.

61
01:04:06.330 --> 01:04:07.330
What kind of army that is.

62
01:04:08.330 --> 01:04:10.330
To look, to go fight, to take that land.

63
01:04:11.330 --> 01:04:13.330
To go fight against that army and win.

64
01:04:14.330 --> 01:04:18.330
And they send, I don't remember if it was 10 or 12.

65
01:04:19.330 --> 01:04:20.330
12 exactly.

66
01:04:21.330 --> 01:04:22.330
12 spies out.

67
01:04:23.330 --> 01:04:27.330
And they go there to look and they come back and report to the people.

68
01:04:28.330 --> 01:04:29.330
And 2 say.

69
01:04:30.330 --> 01:04:31.330
Let me start with the 10.

70
01:04:32.330 --> 01:04:33.330
10 out of the 12 say.

71
01:04:34.330 --> 01:04:35.330
That will never work for Neville.

72
01:04:36.330 --> 01:04:37.330
That really can't happen.

73
01:04:38.330 --> 01:04:39.330
Those are giants, they are so big.

74
01:04:40.330 --> 01:04:41.330
Are we like grasshoppers.

75
01:04:41.330 --> 01:04:42.330
How is that ever going to work out.

76
01:04:43.330 --> 01:04:44.330
But 2 say.

77
01:04:45.330 --> 01:04:47.330
Joshua and Caleb, 2 great heroes.

78
01:04:48.330 --> 01:04:49.330
Say that will work out.

79
01:04:50.330 --> 01:04:51.330
Because they may be big.

80
01:04:52.330 --> 01:04:54.330
But I know someone who is even bigger.

81
01:04:55.330 --> 01:04:58.330
Okay then it is up to the people of Israel.

82
01:04:59.330 --> 01:05:00.330
What are we going to do?

83
01:05:01.330 --> 01:05:02.330
Are we going to take that land?

84
01:05:03.330 --> 01:05:05.330
Or are we not going to take that land?

85
01:05:06.330 --> 01:05:07.330
Are we going to engage in that battle?

86
01:05:08.330 --> 01:05:09.330
Or are we going to stay here in the desert?

87
01:05:10.330 --> 01:05:12.330
And they choose to believe those 10.

88
01:05:13.330 --> 01:05:14.330
And to stay in the desert.

89
01:05:16.330 --> 01:05:17.330
Well, God's stamp is there.

90
01:05:18.330 --> 01:05:19.330
No faith.

91
01:05:20.330 --> 01:05:21.330
And no obedience.

92
01:05:22.330 --> 01:05:23.330
What happens?

93
01:05:24.330 --> 01:05:25.330
Consequence.

94
01:05:26.330 --> 01:05:27.330
40 years wandering in the desert.

95
01:05:28.330 --> 01:05:30.330
While it could have been a few weeks.

96
01:05:31.330 --> 01:05:32.330
No miracle from God.

97
01:05:34.330 --> 01:05:35.330
Then after 40 years.

98
01:05:36.330 --> 01:05:37.330
They are allowed by God.

99
01:05:37.330 --> 01:05:38.330
Out of the desert.

100
01:05:39.330 --> 01:05:42.330
And then there is a gigantic walled city.

101
01:05:43.330 --> 01:05:44.330
Jericho.

102
01:05:45.330 --> 01:05:46.330
That is impossible to take.

103
01:05:47.330 --> 01:05:48.330
How is that going to happen?

104
01:05:49.330 --> 01:05:50.330
And then God speaks again.

105
01:05:51.330 --> 01:05:52.330
You must walk around it.

106
01:05:53.330 --> 01:05:54.330
Every day.

107
01:05:55.330 --> 01:05:56.330
For 6 days long.

108
01:05:57.330 --> 01:05:59.330
And on the 7th day, you must walk around it 7 times.

109
01:06:00.330 --> 01:06:01.330
Worshipers in front.

110
01:06:02.330 --> 01:06:03.330
Thank you for leading us.

111
01:06:04.330 --> 01:06:05.330
So important in the worship.

112
01:06:06.330 --> 01:06:07.330
God's stamp is on it.

113
01:06:08.330 --> 01:06:09.330
You must walk around the city.

114
01:06:10.330 --> 01:06:11.330
Faith.

115
01:06:12.330 --> 01:06:13.330
How can that be?

116
01:06:14.330 --> 01:06:16.330
What is the point of walking around that city?

117
01:06:17.330 --> 01:06:18.330
But they did not say that.

118
01:06:19.330 --> 01:06:20.330
No, they were going to do it.

119
01:06:21.330 --> 01:06:22.330
Step 3, obedience.

120
01:06:24.330 --> 01:06:26.330
And then you see those walls collapse.

121
01:06:27.330 --> 01:06:28.330
The city is completely taken over.

122
01:06:29.330 --> 01:06:32.330
And the people of Israel enter the promised land.

123
01:06:32.330 --> 01:06:34.330
The people of Israel enter the promised land.

124
01:06:35.330 --> 01:06:39.330
These are three examples of how God works.

125
01:06:40.330 --> 01:06:41.330
Through wonders.

126
01:06:42.330 --> 01:06:43.330
To build his kingdom.

127
01:06:44.330 --> 01:06:46.330
Then you could say, that is the people of Israel.

128
01:06:47.330 --> 01:06:48.330
That was very important.

129
01:06:49.330 --> 01:06:50.330
That was chosen by God.

130
01:06:51.330 --> 01:06:52.330
That makes sense.

131
01:06:53.330 --> 01:06:54.330
That God blesses them.

132
01:06:55.330 --> 01:06:56.330
But it is still the same God.

133
01:06:57.330 --> 01:06:58.330
Who is with us.

134
01:06:59.330 --> 01:07:00.330
Who is here.

135
01:07:00.330 --> 01:07:03.330
And then you could say, this is a congregation of 300 people.

136
01:07:04.330 --> 01:07:05.330
A small church.

137
01:07:06.330 --> 01:07:08.330
What does that represent in the global event?

138
01:07:09.330 --> 01:07:12.330
But you know, you are as a person all alone.

139
01:07:13.330 --> 01:07:14.330
Amidst billions of people on this earth.

140
01:07:15.330 --> 01:07:16.330
Extremely precious.

141
01:07:17.330 --> 01:07:18.330
God is with you.

142
01:07:19.330 --> 01:07:20.330
As you were with Israel.

143
01:07:21.330 --> 01:07:23.330
And this congregation is extremely precious to God.

144
01:07:24.330 --> 01:07:25.330
To build his kingdom.

145
01:07:26.330 --> 01:07:27.330
To give people the way.

146
01:07:28.330 --> 01:07:29.330
A way to find him.

147
01:07:31.330 --> 01:07:32.330
So God is with this congregation.

148
01:07:33.330 --> 01:07:37.330
So that same God who performed those miracles around the desert.

149
01:07:38.330 --> 01:07:40.330
Is here in this congregation.

150
01:07:41.330 --> 01:07:42.330
And performs miracles here.

151
01:07:43.330 --> 01:07:47.330
And we have seen quite a few examples of that over the years.

152
01:07:49.330 --> 01:07:52.330
Kees and Agnes are together.

153
01:07:53.330 --> 01:07:56.330
Or better said, together with the Holy Spirit.

154
01:07:57.330 --> 01:08:00.330
This congregation started 41 years ago.

155
01:08:01.330 --> 01:08:05.330
And during that time it slowly began to build up.

156
01:08:06.330 --> 01:08:07.330
The first people came to repentance.

157
01:08:08.330 --> 01:08:09.330
The congregation began to grow.

158
01:08:10.330 --> 01:08:14.330
But then it was just renting a community center here and there.

159
01:08:15.330 --> 01:08:17.330
And we have wandered all over the camps.

160
01:08:18.330 --> 01:08:20.330
In every village we have held services.

161
01:08:21.330 --> 01:08:25.330
But at a certain point, the opportunity arose to buy this building.

162
01:08:26.330 --> 01:08:29.330
That was the old part there without this hall.

163
01:08:30.330 --> 01:08:32.330
But we had no money.

164
01:08:33.330 --> 01:08:35.330
Because we had just 1 or 2 years before.

165
01:08:36.330 --> 01:08:38.330
We had already spent all the money that we had saved as a congregation.

166
01:08:39.330 --> 01:08:43.330
We had put it all into a gigantic evangelism campaign.

167
01:08:44.330 --> 01:08:45.330
And all the money was gone.

168
01:08:46.330 --> 01:08:48.330
But this building came and God spoke.

169
01:08:48.330 --> 01:08:50.330
You must buy this building.

170
01:08:51.330 --> 01:08:52.330
Step 1.

171
01:08:53.330 --> 01:08:54.330
Hearing God's voice.

172
01:08:55.330 --> 01:08:56.330
Step 2. Faith.

173
01:08:57.330 --> 01:08:58.330
Yes, that is completely impossible.

174
01:08:59.330 --> 01:09:02.330
At that moment, we were a congregation of about 50 people.

175
01:09:03.330 --> 01:09:07.330
How can you buy a building like this with a congregation of 50 people?

176
01:09:08.330 --> 01:09:09.330
But.

177
01:09:10.330 --> 01:09:11.330
Faith.

178
01:09:12.330 --> 01:09:13.330
Kees and Agnes had.

179
01:09:14.330 --> 01:09:15.330
We had together as a church.

180
01:09:15.330 --> 01:09:16.330
We said yes.

181
01:09:17.330 --> 01:09:18.330
I don't know how, but we will do it.

182
01:09:19.330 --> 01:09:20.330
And it worked.

183
01:09:21.330 --> 01:09:22.330
We bought the building.

184
01:09:23.330 --> 01:09:24.330
Step 3. Obedience.

185
01:09:25.330 --> 01:09:27.330
And then a number of years later, God said.

186
01:09:28.330 --> 01:09:29.330
Build a large hall next to it.

187
01:09:30.330 --> 01:09:31.330
The money was completely gone again.

188
01:09:32.330 --> 01:09:34.330
Because it had gone into the purchase of this building.

189
01:09:35.330 --> 01:09:36.330
But again, it just worked out.

190
01:09:38.330 --> 01:09:39.330
And.

191
01:09:40.330 --> 01:09:41.330
Even now.

192
01:09:42.330 --> 01:09:43.330
You can say, yes.

193
01:09:43.330 --> 01:09:44.330
This will never work.

194
01:09:45.330 --> 01:09:48.330
Okay, 600,000, 700,000 saved is a lot of money.

195
01:09:49.330 --> 01:09:50.330
But if we need millions.

196
01:09:51.330 --> 01:09:52.330
How will that ever work?

197
01:09:53.330 --> 01:09:55.330
But we must keep our focus on God.

198
01:09:56.330 --> 01:09:58.330
As you see in all these examples.

199
01:09:59.330 --> 01:10:01.330
God is not the God of human possibilities.

200
01:10:02.330 --> 01:10:04.330
God is the God of heavenly possibilities.

201
01:10:05.330 --> 01:10:06.330
And God is going to do it.

202
01:10:07.330 --> 01:10:08.330
And what is very important for us.

203
01:10:09.330 --> 01:10:10.330
Is to stand behind that.

204
01:10:10.330 --> 01:10:11.330
We have the choice together.

205
01:10:12.330 --> 01:10:14.330
Are we going to go with those 10 people who say.

206
01:10:15.330 --> 01:10:16.330
That will never work.

207
01:10:17.330 --> 01:10:19.330
Or are we going to go with those 2 who say.

208
01:10:20.330 --> 01:10:22.330
Yes, we will succeed because God is with us.

209
01:10:23.330 --> 01:10:24.330
And I really find it important.

210
01:10:25.330 --> 01:10:27.330
And that's why I have spent a bit more time on it.

211
01:10:28.330 --> 01:10:31.330
Because I understand that these kinds of amounts are heavy for us.

212
01:10:32.330 --> 01:10:35.330
You don't just encounter them in your private life.

213
01:10:36.330 --> 01:10:38.330
But it is important that we are one together.

214
01:10:38.330 --> 01:10:40.330
That we believe in it as one.

215
01:10:41.330 --> 01:10:42.330
That we stand behind it as one.

216
01:10:43.330 --> 01:10:46.330
Do you remember that I mentioned in my sermon 2 weeks ago.

217
01:10:47.330 --> 01:10:50.330
That it is as if we all have an arrow above our heads.

218
01:10:51.330 --> 01:10:53.330
And that arrow is pointing in a certain direction.

219
01:10:54.330 --> 01:10:57.330
And this is a perfect example of how that works.

220
01:10:58.330 --> 01:11:01.330
So Tim has his arrow pointing in that direction.

221
01:11:02.330 --> 01:11:03.330
We are going to do this building.

222
01:11:04.330 --> 01:11:06.330
For God has spoken very clearly to him.

223
01:11:06.330 --> 01:11:09.330
Then we can all have different opinions.

224
01:11:10.330 --> 01:11:13.330
Can that be done, must it be done, must it be such a building.

225
01:11:14.330 --> 01:11:17.330
Can't we just stay in this building and have 3 services per Sunday?

226
01:11:18.330 --> 01:11:23.330
And so you can have many opinions about how this should be or what should happen.

227
01:11:24.330 --> 01:11:26.330
Because we will no longer fit in this hall.

228
01:11:27.330 --> 01:11:29.330
And then your arrow points that way, your arrow points that way.

229
01:11:30.330 --> 01:11:33.330
But let's all go with Tim, with God, behind this.

230
01:11:33.330 --> 01:11:35.330
That we are going to do this building.

231
01:11:36.330 --> 01:11:38.330
Whether it is humanly possible or not.

232
01:11:41.330 --> 01:11:44.330
Just a few practical things around this.

233
01:11:45.330 --> 01:11:49.330
So a lot has been given in the past months and that is great.

234
01:11:50.330 --> 01:11:55.330
But some people have stopped their normal monthly donations.

235
01:11:56.330 --> 01:12:00.330
And instead, they have started making monthly donations for the building.

236
01:12:00.330 --> 01:12:03.330
Well, that is well-intentioned, but it is not practical.

237
01:12:04.330 --> 01:12:08.330
Because for normal functioning, we also just need money.

238
01:12:09.330 --> 01:12:17.330
So please, do not give for the building instead of for normal functioning and nothing else.

239
01:12:18.330 --> 01:12:28.330
Secondly, in the app it is important, if you pay with the QR code, you can sometimes check the app.

240
01:12:28.330 --> 01:12:32.330
If you pay with the QR code, you can add a comment.

241
01:12:33.330 --> 01:12:35.330
It is for the building, but we do not see that remark.

242
01:12:36.330 --> 01:12:38.330
That is how it technically works at the bank.

243
01:12:39.330 --> 01:12:43.330
So please do not give via the QR code.

244
01:12:44.330 --> 01:12:46.330
You can use the app.

245
01:12:47.330 --> 01:12:52.330
When you open the church's app, then in the middle at the bottom is the icon to give.

246
01:12:53.330 --> 01:12:59.330
And then you have at the top, but that is very unclear to see, which is why I mention it briefly.

247
01:13:00.330 --> 01:13:08.330
Then you have two tabs at the top. The one on the top left is for collections and the one on the top right is for the building project.

248
01:13:09.330 --> 01:13:13.330
So if you want to give, do it via the app, through that tab on the top right.

249
01:13:14.330 --> 01:13:18.330
Or make a bank transfer and mention for the building.

250
01:13:18.330 --> 01:13:22.330
Father, I want to thank you that you are a great, mighty God.

251
01:13:23.330 --> 01:13:25.330
I find it so amazing, Lord, how you are building this congregation.

252
01:13:26.330 --> 01:13:29.330
How your eye and your love are on the Kempen, Lord.

253
01:13:30.330 --> 01:13:32.330
That you love this region dearly.

254
01:13:33.330 --> 01:13:35.330
And that you want people to be saved.

255
01:13:36.330 --> 01:13:40.330
And I thank you, Lord, that you have built and upheld the congregation proudly.

256
01:13:41.330 --> 01:13:42.330
Through all the storms.

