574
01:45:54.330 --> 01:45:57.330
that it is better to leave the Lord.

575
01:45:57.330 --> 01:45:59.330
That is what he does.

576
01:46:08.330 --> 01:46:11.330
In the delay.

577
01:46:11.330 --> 01:46:18.330
In the delay between injustice and the righteousness that is to come.

