600
01:48:18.330 --> 01:48:20.330
Injustice is the reality.

601
01:48:22.330 --> 01:48:24.330
The enemy is real.

602
01:48:25.330 --> 01:48:27.330
Delay is real.

603
01:48:27.330 --> 01:48:29.330
But there is a response.

604
01:48:30.330 --> 01:48:32.330
And that is also necessary.

605
01:48:34.330 --> 01:48:36.330
So the second thing...

606
01:48:36.330 --> 01:48:39.330
righteousness comes, but there is a delay in it.

