669
01:55:48.330 --> 01:56:02.330
It is not Him there and I here and a huge distance. It is Him in me and I in Him.

670
01:56:07.330 --> 01:56:12.330
But just like any healthy marriage, intimacy is needed for that.

671
01:56:14.330 --> 01:56:16.330
Time is needed for that.

672
01:56:18.330 --> 01:56:35.330
Jesus says, the unique response at that moment is my people with me in persistent prayer.

673
01:56:35.330 --> 01:56:53.330
