684
01:58:51.330 --> 01:58:53.330
No passivity.

685
01:58:55.330 --> 01:58:58.330
That we see things and do not pray.

686
01:59:03.330 --> 01:59:09.330
Whether it is personal, in the church, or in the whole world. Passivity is not the answer.

687
01:59:10.330 --> 01:59:18.330
Anger is ultimately not the answer. You may get angry, but you cannot stay there.

688
01:59:19.330 --> 01:59:21.330
It will produce nothing.

689
01:59:23.330 --> 01:59:27.330
It will not fulfill God's purposes.

690
01:59:31.330 --> 01:59:35.330
The only thing He gives is a persistent spirit in prayer.

691
01:59:39.330 --> 01:59:43.330
The Lord says in the end, will the Son of Man find faith?

692
01:59:53.330 --> 01:59:56.330
He ends the parable with a question.

693
02:00:00.330 --> 02:00:04.330
He says, the only thing is prayer without ceasing.

694
02:00:05.330 --> 02:00:11.330
He encourages the disciples and says, just like that widow, there will ultimately be justice on the earth.

695
02:00:11.330 --> 02:00:13.330
