696
02:00:18.330 --> 02:00:25.330
The judge in this parable says, the only thing you can do is prayer without ceasing.

697
02:00:26.330 --> 02:00:32.330
And because the widow persists and does not stop, He ultimately says, okay, then you will get what you ask for.

698
02:00:42.330 --> 02:00:46.330
And the Son of Man says, the only thing is prayer without ceasing.

699
02:00:49.330 --> 02:00:52.330
The only thing is prayer without ceasing.

700
02:00:55.330 --> 02:00:58.330
