701
02:00:59.330 --> 02:01:00.330
A man.

702
02:01:00.330 --> 02:01:01.330
It is ours.

703
02:01:01.330 --> 02:01:04.330
He says, you cry for justice, do you think He does not give it?

704
02:01:04.330 --> 02:01:05.330
Of course it is Him.

705
02:01:06.330 --> 02:01:07.330
Stay.

706
02:01:17.330 --> 02:01:21.330
Stay in my words, stay in the prayer, stay connected with the Lord.

707
02:01:26.330 --> 02:01:33.330
He says, will there be faith on earth when I return?

708
02:01:38.330 --> 02:01:41.330
The context is prayer, prayer is prayer, prayer is prayer.

709
02:01:41.330 --> 02:01:44.330
He says, will there be faith on earth when I return?

710
02:01:44.330 --> 02:01:47.330
Will there be faith on earth when I return?

711
02:01:47.330 --> 02:01:50.330
Come Lord, fulfill your purpose, let your kingdom come.

712
02:01:50.330 --> 02:01:54.330
Let your will be done on earth, as it is already in heaven.

713
02:01:54.330 --> 02:01:56.330
That is what He seeks.

714
02:01:56.330 --> 02:02:00.330
And faith and prayer go hand in hand, for it is prayer in faith.

715
02:02:00.330 --> 02:02:07.330
