718
02:02:20.330 --> 02:02:22.330
Work with me.

719
02:02:22.330 --> 02:02:24.330
Believe me.

720
02:02:24.330 --> 02:02:26.330
Trust me.

721
02:02:27.330 --> 02:02:29.330
Obey me.

722
02:02:31.330 --> 02:02:33.330
Be with me.

723
02:02:36.330 --> 02:02:39.330
And stand with me in that place of intercession.

724
02:02:43.330 --> 02:02:47.330
For I will come and I will bring righteousness to the earth.

725
02:02:48.330 --> 02:02:51.330
So stand with me and we will pray for something this morning.

726
02:02:56.330 --> 02:02:57.330
Just like the band plays.

727
02:02:57.330 --> 02:03:06.330
Lord, we know that you are the God of righteousness.

728
02:03:06.330 --> 02:03:08.330
And we see injustice.

729
02:03:08.330 --> 02:03:12.330
We see the traffic in our lives.

730
02:03:12.330 --> 02:03:14.330
We see it all around us.

731
02:03:17.330 --> 02:03:18.330
Just this morning.

732
02:03:18.330 --> 02:03:22.330
If that has added to the injustice in your own life.

733
02:03:22.330 --> 02:03:27.330
Maybe there are unheard places where things have been done against you.

734
02:03:27.330 --> 02:03:33.330
And the Lord wants to heal you, for the enemy can use that space to take your faith.

735
02:03:33.330 --> 02:03:35.330
And to take your faith.

736
02:03:48.330 --> 02:03:56.330
Ask the Lord to heal those places.

737
02:03:56.330 --> 02:04:02.330
To let that oil of forgiveness flow.

738
02:04:02.330 --> 02:04:07.330
We need to release forgiveness.

739
02:04:07.330 --> 02:04:11.330
So that we are free ourselves.

740
02:04:11.330 --> 02:04:15.330
I am not talking about being reconciled with someone who has murdered you.

741
02:04:15.330 --> 02:04:17.330
Or you have done something.

742
02:04:17.330 --> 02:04:19.330
I am talking about forgiveness.

743
02:04:19.330 --> 02:04:22.330
So that there is no unhealed space.

744
02:04:22.330 --> 02:04:24.330
