745
02:04:36.330 --> 02:04:39.330
It is about your freedom.

746
02:04:39.330 --> 02:04:46.330
It is about your direct connection with the Lord.

747
02:04:46.330 --> 02:04:48.330
And with His body.

748
02:04:48.330 --> 02:04:50.330
With His people.

749
02:04:50.330 --> 02:04:56.330
So this morning I want to pray for brothers and sisters.

750
02:04:57.330 --> 02:05:11.330
