752
02:05:22.330 --> 02:05:31.330
And Lord, I pray that there will be a run to you.

753
02:05:37.330 --> 02:05:42.330
For you are not deaf and you are not blind to any injustice in our lives.

754
02:05:42.330 --> 02:05:54.330
And I want to pray for a healing anointing that flows through our hearts.

755
02:06:00.330 --> 02:06:06.330
So that we can come into alignment with God's purpose in our lives.

756
02:06:13.330 --> 02:06:19.330
